  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 900,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 🌊 Quality of the functional (BOLD) scans\n\nEach number describes **one BOLD run** — one task, one acquisition, for one participant and session. The dominant quality problem in child and adolescent fMRI is **head motion**, so that is the first row.\n\n**Reading the colours**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| 🟢 🟡 🔴 | A conventional range exists — colour is a judgement |\n| 🔵 | Descriptive only — compare across the cohort |\n\nA run is counted once. Reprocessed runs write a new record each time, and only the latest is shown."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Runs QC'd",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-athena",
        "type": "grafana-athena-datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "connectionArgs": {
            "catalog": "__default",
            "database": "__default",
            "region": "__default"
          },
          "rawSQL": "WITH d AS (SELECT *, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY subject, session, task, run ORDER BY completed_at DESC) AS rn FROM cloudpipe_metrics.func_preproc WHERE ('${subject}' = 'All' OR subject = '${subject}') AND ('${session}' = 'All' OR session = '${session}') AND ('${task}' = 'All' OR task = '${task}') AND from_iso8601_timestamp(completed_at) BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND CAST(dt AS DATE) BETWEEN CAST($__timeFrom() AS DATE) AND CAST($__timeTo() AS DATE)) SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_runs, ROUND(AVG(mean_fd), 3) AS mean_fd, ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN pct_fd_above_0p5 > 10 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 1) AS pct_high_motion, ROUND(AVG(tsnr_median), 1) AS avg_tsnr, ROUND(AVG(max_fd), 3) AS avg_max_fd, ROUND(100.0 * SUM(n_fd_above_0p2) / NULLIF(SUM(n_frames), 0), 1) AS pct_frames_above_0p2, ROUND(AVG(mean_dvars), 2) AS mean_dvars, ROUND(AVG(gcor), 3) AS gcor, ROUND(AVG(aor), 4) AS aor, ROUND(AVG(aqi), 4) AS aqi, ROUND(AVG(total_runtime_s) / 60.0, 1) AS mean_min, ROUND(APPROX_PERCENTILE(peak_memory_gb, 0.95), 1) AS peak_mem_p95_gb, ROUND(APPROX_PERCENTILE(container_peak_memory_gb, 0.95), 1) AS container_peak_mem_p95_gb, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.boldref) / 60, 2) AS boldref, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.composite_warp) / 60, 2) AS composite_warp, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.\"4d_warp\") / 60, 2) AS warp_4d, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.mask_warp) / 60, 2) AS mask_warp, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.masking) / 60, 2) AS masking, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.confounds) / 60, 2) AS confounds, ROUND(AVG(stage_timings_s.grayordinates) / 60, 2) AS grayordinates, ROUND(AVG(n_acompcor_wm), 1) AS aCompCor_WM, ROUND(AVG(n_acompcor_csf), 1) AS aCompCor_CSF, ROUND(AVG(n_tcompcor), 1) AS tCompCor, ROUND(AVG(n_cosines), 1) AS Cosines FROM d WHERE rn = 1"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "Distinct BOLD runs represented on this dashboard, after deduplicating to the latest attempt per run. This is the denominator for every average and percentage below — read it first.",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/^n_runs$/"
        }
      }
    },
    {
